nansiell ställning. * LED-panelen Profoto ProPanel utvecklas enligt plan. – Anders Hedebark, VD +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | | Jul–sep | Jul–sep | Jan–sep | Jan–sep | Oct | Helår | | | 2026 | 2025 | 2026 | 2025 | 2025–sep | 2025 | | | | | | | 2026 | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | | 128 | 119 | 419 | 454 | 582 | 617 | | Nettoomsättning, | | | | | | | | SEKm | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | Organisk | 7,7 | −22,6 | −3,0 | −10,5 | −4,8 | −10,4 | | tillväxt, % | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | EBITDA, SEKm | 40 | 4 | 96 | 71 | 129 | 104 | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | | 30,9 | 3,2 | 22,9 | 15,7 | 22,1 | 16,8 | | EBITDA-marginal, | | | | | | | | % | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | EBITA, SEKm | 34 | −2 | 81 | 54 | 108 | 81 | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | | 26,6 | −1,9 | 19,2 | 11,9 | 18,5 | 13,2 | | EBITA-marginal, | | | | | | | | % | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | EBIT, SEKm | 19 | −57 | 35 | −22 | 51 | −6 | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | | 14,6 | −47,9 | 8,5 | −4,9 | 8,8 | −1,0 | | EBIT-marginal, | | | | | | | | % | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | Justerad | 19 | −10 | 35 | 25 | 51 | 41 | | EBIT, SEKm | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | Justerad | 14,6 | −8,4 | 8,5 | 5,5 | 8,8 | 6,6 | | EBIT-marginal, | | | | | | | | % | | | | | | | +--------------+---------+---------+---------+---------+----------+----------+ | Periodens | 14 | −48 | 26 | −30 | 34 | −23 | | 